Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.19,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"Squishy Squishy Puni Puni Punirunes{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.66,0:01:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This is Airune, a perky Punirune\Nfull of curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Enerune is energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.39,0:01:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Loverune is full of big love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ururune is prone to tears\Nbut is great at drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Coolrune is fashionable and tidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Punirunes are full of energy as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is gonna come out\Nsuper squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\NI call it the Oden Konjac Bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuka here lives with Airune\Nand loves all things squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What would that even taste like?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.51,0:01:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuka's best friend Aoi lives with Enerune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This is squish contact.\NIt's how puni-pals greet each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.32,0:02:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna squish you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There really is nothing more calming\Nthan squishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.63,0:02:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It's time!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. You're all visiting Jewelrune today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ururune proposes they go find gifts to bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.69,0:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.98,0:02:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, off to Puniland!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:03:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is Puniland, the squishsterious\Nrealm of the Punirunes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune and friends are at the Puni Market\Nto find gifts for Jewelrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which one will you bring?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're just for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.31,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ururune and Jewelrune are picking out\Na fashionable gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait a minute.\NAre you here to find a gift or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, Loverune.\NYou're just looking for yourself too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:04:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, you've found your gifts,\Nso it's time to go see Jewelrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This here is Kachikochiland.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where could Jewelrune's castle be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"We're pleased by your arrival!\NPrince Jewelrune awaits!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Onwards, to the castle where Jewelrune waits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Jewelrune is the prince of Kachikochiland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Is it prepared?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.69,0:05:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Let the party begin!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Enjoy yourselves!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Allow us to perform a dance for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The attendants do a kachi-stiff dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ururune does a squishsterious dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Ahh, that was very fun."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.84,0:06:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You can stay as long as you like!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I mean it! Stay here forever!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fs-1}"Stay here forever!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fs-3}"Stay here forever!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"It is our duty to fulfill Jewelrune's wishes."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.20,0:07:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You shall remain here in Kachikochiland forever!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Now! Service them!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hold on... you all..."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Halt! We're not done servicing you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"You can use this seesaw to jump over the wall!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All hope is lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.89,0:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I found something odd in the forest."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.35,0:09:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"But what is it? Pray tell!\NWhat ever could it be?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Please investigate!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Now's your chance."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Thanks! See you later!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Come play with me again, okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back! So, did you have fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Their journey was full of surprises,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.52,0:09:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the Punirunes enjoyed themselves a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.74,0:09:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Airune is a big foodie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It loves all squishy foods!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And it love-love-{\i1}loves{\i0} getting squished itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens to Airune after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,462)}1. It turns kachi-freezy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.94,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,688.67)}2. It turns kara-dry
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,923.33)}3. It turns gari-crunchy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,1. It turns kachi-freezy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Airune turned into a Babyrune!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.15,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeding it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking it to the potty...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking care of it is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.58,0:12:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Airune Becomes a Babyrune{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
